{"id":"cruf1gqsztj5pu7568a34ok4d","title":"从 Swift 转向 Rust：编程语言的新趋势","originalTitle":"On Leaving Swift for Rust","summary":"昨日，作者辞去了 Swift Android 工作组的职务，转而支持 Rust。尽管他高度评价 Swift 的性能和开发者友好性，但认为 Swift 在非 Apple 平台上将永远无法提供无缝体验。文章指出，随着软件开发转向由计算机自动生成代码，Rust 等“计算机语言”正逐渐成为主流，包括 PostgreSQL 和 TypeScript 在内的多个大型项目正从 Swift 转向 Rust。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://www.prux.org/posts/goodbye-swift-hello-rust/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T17:56:45.490Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-16T18:30:31.760Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-16T18:30:31.760Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["新项目","技术方案","GitHub"],"score":37,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"8360d5e6-f68b-4417-b8fc-12702a5e76fc","title":"开发者从Swift转向Rust，多项目跟进"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"8360d5e6-f68b-4417-b8fc-12702a5e76fc","title":"开发者从Swift转向Rust，多项目跟进"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fiL9JUF0MCNA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}